<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard - IT Portal & Asset Management</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Bootstrap Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <!-- Chart.js CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.3/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
    <!-- SweetAlert2 CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11"></script>
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: #334155;
        }
        .navbar-brand { letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .card {
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }
        .kpi-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
        .chart-container {
            position: relative;
            height: 240px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .table th {
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: #64748b;
            background-color: #f1f5f9 !important;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .table td {
            vertical-align: middle;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }
        .badge {
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 0.35em 0.65em;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }
        .btn {
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .pagination .page-link {
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 0 2px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: #475569;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .pagination .page-item.active .page-link {
            background-color: #0d6efd;
            border-color: #0d6efd;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .live-indicator {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4); }
            70% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0); }
            100% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 197, 94, 0); }
        }

        /* ==================== OPTIMASI MOBILE RESPONSIVE ==================== */
        @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
            .container {
                padding-left: 14px;
                padding-right: 14px;
            }
            /* Perkecil tinggi grafik sedikit agar proporsional di layar HP */
            .chart-container {
                height: 200px;
            }
            /* Jaga agar sel tabel tidak gepeng ke bawah saat di-scroll horizontal */
            .table th, .table td {
                white-space: nowrap;
                font-size: 0.82rem;
                padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
            }
            /* Kecuali kolom judul/deskripsi tetap diberi batas lebar agar rapi */
            .table td.col-wrap {
                white-space: normal;
                min-width: 200px;
            }
            /* Sesuaikan ukuran kartu KPI di HP */
            .kpi-icon {
                width: 40px;
                height: 40px;
                font-size: 1.15rem;
            }
            h3.fw-bold {
                font-size: 1.35rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

<!-- NAVBAR MODERN & MOBILE RESPONSIVE -->
<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark sticky-top shadow-sm py-2 py-lg-3">
    <div class="container">
        <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fs-6 fs-lg-5" href="/dashboard">
            <i class="bi bi-cpu-fill text-primary"></i> IT Support & Asset
        </a>

        <!-- Tombol Hamburger untuk Layar HP/Tablet -->
        <button class="navbar-toggler border-0 shadow-none" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarUserMenu" aria-controls="navbarUserMenu" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
            <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
        </button>

        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-end mt-2 mt-lg-0" id="navbarUserMenu">
            <% if (user) { %>
                <div class="dropdown pt-2 pt-lg-0 border-top border-secondary border-opacity-25 border-lg-0">
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-light d-flex align-items-center gap-2 dropdown-toggle" type="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
                        <span class="rounded-circle bg-primary d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 34px; height: 34px;">
                            <i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i>
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-start">
                            <span class="d-block fw-semibold small"><%= user.nama %></span>
                            <span class="d-block text-light opacity-75" style="font-size: 0.7rem;"><%= user.role %></span>
                        </span>
                    </button>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end shadow mt-2">
                        <li class="px-3 py-2">
                            <div class="fw-semibold"><%= user.nama %></div>
                            <small class="text-muted"><%= user.departemen %> &bull; <span class="text-uppercase"><%= user.role %></span></small>
                        </li>
                        <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>
                        <li><a href="/logout" class="dropdown-item text-danger"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right me-2"></i>Keluar</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>
<br>
<!-- HEADER & LIVE STATUS -->
<div class="row align-items-center mb-4 g-2">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-6 pb">
        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-dark fs-5 fs-md-4">Dashboard Operasional IT</h4>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Ringkasan analitik tiket bantuan dan kondisi inventaris perangkat IT.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-start justify-content-md-end align-items-center gap-2">
        <% if (user.role === 'admin') { %>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-dark btn-sm px-3 shadow-sm d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#createUserModal">
                <i class="bi bi-person-plus-fill text-info"></i> Tambah User
            </button>
        <% } %>
        <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-pill border shadow-sm small">
            <span class="live-indicator me-2"></span>
            <span class="text-muted">Live Auto-Refresh (5s)</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

        <!-- ==================== KPI SUMMARY CARDS ==================== -->
        <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
            <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                <div class="card p-3">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-medium mb-1">Total Tiket Masuk</div>
                            <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0" id="kpi-total-tickets">0</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="kpi-icon bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-ticket-detailed"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                <div class="card p-3">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-medium mb-1">Tiket Aktif (Open/Proses)</div>
                            <h3 class="fw-bold text-warning mb-0" id="kpi-open-tickets">0</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="kpi-icon bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning">
                            <i class="bi bi-hourglass-split"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                <div class="card p-3">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-medium mb-1">Total Perangkat Terdata</div>
                            <h3 class="fw-bold text-success mb-0" id="kpi-total-assets">0</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="kpi-icon bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success">
                            <i class="bi bi-laptop"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                <div class="card p-3">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-muted small fw-medium mb-1">Perangkat Bermasalah</div>
                            <h3 class="fw-bold text-danger mb-0" id="kpi-issue-assets">0</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="kpi-icon bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger">
                            <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ==================== CHARTS / GRAFIK ANALITIK ==================== -->
        <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="card p-4 h-100">
                    <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1">Status Tiket IT Support</h6>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-3">Distribusi penyelesaian keluhan</p>
                    <div class="chart-container">
                        <canvas id="ticketStatusChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="card p-4 h-100">
                    <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1">Stok & Jenis Perangkat</h6>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-3">Jumlah unit berdasarkan kategori hardware</p>
                    <div class="chart-container">
                        <canvas id="assetTypeChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="card p-4 h-100">
                    <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1">Kesehatan Perangkat IT</h6>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-3">Kondisi fisik unit yang dipinjam karyawan</p>
                    <div class="chart-container">
                        <canvas id="assetConditionChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
            <!-- HEADER CARD 1: TIKET IT SUPPORT -->
            <div class="card-header bg-white border-0 d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3 pt-4 pb-3 px-4">
                <div>
                    <h5 class="mb-1 fw-bold text-dark">
                        <i class="bi bi-ticket-detailed text-primary me-2"></i>
                        <%= user.role === 'admin' ? 'Daftar Semua Tiket IT Support' : 'Riwayat Tiket IT Saya' %>
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                        <%= user.role === 'admin' ? 'Permintaan bantuan dan pengadaan dari seluruh divisi.' : 'Daftar pengajuan bantuan dan pengadaan yang Anda kirimkan.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
                    <!-- Input Search Tiket -->
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm" style="width: 240px;">
                        <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-end-0 text-muted">
                            <i class="bi bi-search"></i>
                        </span>
                        <input type="text" id="ticket-search-input" class="form-control bg-light border-start-0 ps-0" 
                            placeholder="Cari kode, judul, pemohon, status...">
                    </div>
                    <a href="/tickets/new" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm px-3 shadow-sm d-flex align-items-center gap-1">
                        <i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> Buat Tiket
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body px-0 pt-0 pb-2">
                <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0 px-4">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th class="ps-4">Kode Tiket</th>
                                <% if (user.role === 'admin') { %><th>Pemohon</th><% } %>
                                <th>Kategori</th>
                                <th>Judul & Detail Kendala</th>
                                <th>Prioritas</th>
                                <th>Status</th>
                                <th>Catatan IT</th>
                                <% if (user.role === 'admin') { %><th class="text-end pe-4">Aksi</th><% } %>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="ticket-table-body">
                            <tr><td colspan="8" class="text-center text-muted pb-5">Memuat data tiket...</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <!-- Pagination Footer Tiket -->
                <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-between align-items-center px-4 pt-3 pb-2 border-top mt-2">
                    <div class="text-muted small mb-2 mb-sm-0" id="ticket-pagination-info">Menampilkan 0 data</div>
                    <nav aria-label="Navigasi halaman tiket">
                        <ul class="pagination pagination-sm mb-0" id="ticket-pagination-controls"></ul>
                    </nav>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

            <!-- Contoh pada Header Card Inventaris Aset -->
            <!-- HEADER CARD 2: INVENTARIS & STOK PERANGKAT IT -->
            <div class="card-header bg-white border-0 d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3 pt-4 pb-3 px-4">
                <div>
                    <h5 class="mb-1 fw-bold text-dark">
                        <i class="bi bi-laptop text-success me-2"></i>
                        <%= user.role === 'admin' ? 'Inventaris & Perangkat IT Seluruh Karyawan' : 'Perangkat IT yang Saya Pinjam' %>
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                        <%= user.role === 'admin' ? 'Pendataan perangkat seluruh karyawan untuk laporan stok dan audit.' : 'Daftar laptop dan perangkat pendukung yang tercatat atas nama Anda.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
                    <!-- Input Search Perangkat -->
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm" style="width: 240px;">
                        <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-end-0 text-muted">
                            <i class="bi bi-search"></i>
                        </span>
                        <input type="text" id="asset-search-input" class="form-control bg-light border-start-0 ps-0" 
                            placeholder="Cari merk, S/N, jenis, kondisi...">
                    </div>
                    <a href="/assets/new" class="btn btn-success btn-sm px-3 shadow-sm d-flex align-items-center gap-1">
                        <i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> Input Perangkat
                    </a>
                    <% if (user.role === 'admin') { %>
                        <a href="/assets/export" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm px-3 shadow-sm d-flex align-items-center gap-1">
                            <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-excel"></i> Export Excel
                        </a>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body px-0 pt-0 pb-2">
                <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0 px-4">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <% if (user.role === 'admin') { %><th class="ps-4">Pemegang & Divisi</th><% } %>
                                <th class="<%= user.role !== 'admin' ? 'ps-4' : '' %>">Jenis</th>
                                <th>Merk & Tipe</th>
                                <th>Serial Number</th>
                                <th>Kode Aset</th>
                                <th>Kondisi</th>
                                <th>Kelengkapan</th>
                                <th>Keterangan</th>
                                <th class="text-end pe-4">Aksi</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="asset-table-body">
                            <tr><td colspan="9" class="text-center text-muted pb-5">Memuat data inventaris...</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <!-- Pagination Footer Aset -->
                <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-between align-items-center px-4 pt-3 pb-2 border-top mt-2">
                    <div class="text-muted small mb-2 mb-sm-0" id="asset-pagination-info">Menampilkan 0 data</div>
                    <nav aria-label="Navigasi halaman aset">
                        <ul class="pagination pagination-sm mb-0" id="asset-pagination-controls"></ul>
                    </nav>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- FOOTER MODERN -->
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <!-- MODAL UPDATE TIKET (KHUSUS ADMIN) -->
    <% if (user.role === 'admin') { %>
    <div class="modal fade" id="editTicketModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <form id="editTicketForm" method="POST" class="modal-content border-0 shadow-lg">
                <div class="modal-header border-0 pb-0 pt-4 px-4">
                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">Update Tiket: <span id="modal-ticket-code" class="text-primary"></span></h5>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body px-4 py-3">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Status Penanganan</label>
                        <select name="status" id="modal-ticket-status" class="form-select" required>
                            <option value="Open">Open</option>
                            <option value="In Progress">In Progress</option>
                            <option value="Resolved">Resolved</option>
                            <option value="Rejected">Rejected</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Catatan / Solusi Tim IT</label>
                        <textarea name="catatan_it" id="modal-ticket-note" rows="3" class="form-control" placeholder="Tuliskan catatan teknis atau solusi..."></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer border-0 pt-0 pb-4 px-4">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-3" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm px-4">Simpan Perubahan</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <!-- MODAL UPDATE KONDISI PERANGKAT (UNTUK USER & ADMIN) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="editAssetModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <form id="editAssetForm" method="POST" class="modal-content border-0 shadow-lg">
                <div class="modal-header border-0 pb-0 pt-4 px-4">
                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">Update Perangkat: <span id="modal-asset-name" class="text-success"></span></h5>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body px-4 py-3">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Kondisi Perangkat Saat Ini</label>
                        <select name="kondisi" id="modal-asset-kondisi" class="form-select" required>
                            <option value="Baik / Normal">Baik / Normal</option>
                            <option value="Rusak Ringan">Rusak Ringan (Masih bisa dipakai)</option>
                            <option value="Perlu Maintenance">Perlu Maintenance / Lemot</option>
                            <option value="Rusak Berat">Rusak Berat (Tidak bisa dipakai)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Kelengkapan Saat Ini</label>
                        <input type="text" name="kelengkapan" id="modal-asset-kelengkapan" class="form-control" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Keterangan Tambahan / Kondisi Fisik</label>
                        <textarea name="keterangan" id="modal-asset-keterangan" rows="3" class="form-control" placeholder="Contoh: Charger masih normal, baterai mulai drop..."></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer border-0 pt-0 pb-4 px-4">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-3" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success btn-sm px-4">Simpan Perubahan</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL CREATE USER BARU (KHUSUS ADMIN) -->
    <% if (user.role === 'admin') { %>
    <div class="modal fade" id="createUserModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <form action="/users/create" method="POST" class="modal-content border-0 shadow-lg">
                <div class="modal-header border-0 pb-0 pt-4 px-4">
                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">
                        <i class="bi bi-person-plus-fill text-primary me-2"></i>Buat Akun User Baru
                    </h5>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body px-4 py-3">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Nama Lengkap Karyawan</label>
                        <input type="text" name="nama" class="form-control" placeholder="Contoh: Rina Marlina" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Email Kantor (Untuk Login)</label>
                        <input type="email" name="email" class="form-control" placeholder="rina@kalinda.co.id" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Departemen / Divisi</label>
                            <select name="departemen" class="form-select" required>
                                <option value="" disabled selected>Pilih Divisi...</option>
                                <option value="Management">Management</option>
                                <option value="Sales & Marketing">Sales & Marketing</option>
                                <option value="Presales Engineer">Presales Engineer</option>
                                <option value="Project & Service">Project & Service</option>
                                <option value="Logistic & Workshop">Logistic & Workshop</option>
                                <option value="Finance / Accounting / Tax">Finance / Accounting / Tax</option>
                                <option value="Supply Chain Management">Supply Chain Management</option>
                                <option value="HR & GA">HR & GA</option>
                                <option value="IT">Departemen IT</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Role Hak Akses</label>
                            <select name="role" class="form-select" required>
                                <option value="user" selected>Karyawan (User)</option>
                                <option value="admin">IT Support (Admin)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Password Awal</label>
                        <input type="password" name="password" class="form-control" placeholder="Minimal 6 karakter" minlength="6" required>
                        <div class="form-text small">Berikan email dan password ini kepada karyawan untuk login pertama kali.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer border-0 pt-0 pb-4 px-4">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-3" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Batal</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm px-4">Simpan User</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
    <% } %>

    <!-- Bootstrap JS Bundle -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

    <!-- Script Chart.js, Pagination & AJAX Auto-Refresh -->
    <script>
        let lastTicketsSnapshot = '';
        let lastAssetsSnapshot = '';

        // State Data & Pagination
        let allTickets = [];
        let allAssets = [];
        let currentUserRole = '<%= user.role %>';

        let ticketSearchQuery = '';
        let assetSearchQuery = '';

        const ITEMS_PER_PAGE = 10;
        let currentTicketPage = 1;
        let currentAssetPage = 1;

        // Helper untuk memfilter data tiket sesuai kata kunci
        function getFilteredTickets() {
            if (!ticketSearchQuery) return allTickets;
            const q = ticketSearchQuery.toLowerCase();
            return allTickets.filter(t =>
                (t.ticket_code && t.ticket_code.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (t.pemohon && t.pemohon.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (t.departemen && t.departemen.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (t.kategori && t.kategori.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (t.judul && t.judul.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (t.deskripsi && t.deskripsi.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (t.prioritas && t.prioritas.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (t.status && t.status.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (t.catatan_it && t.catatan_it.toLowerCase().includes(q))
            );
        }

        // Helper untuk memfilter data aset sesuai kata kunci
        function getFilteredAssets() {
            if (!assetSearchQuery) return allAssets;
            const q = assetSearchQuery.toLowerCase();
            return allAssets.filter(a =>
                (a.pemegang && a.pemegang.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (a.departemen && a.departemen.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (a.jenis_perangkat && a.jenis_perangkat.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (a.merk_tipe && a.merk_tipe.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (a.serial_number && a.serial_number.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (a.kode_aset && a.kode_aset.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (a.kondisi && a.kondisi.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (a.kelengkapan && a.kelengkapan.toLowerCase().includes(q)) ||
                (a.keterangan && a.keterangan.toLowerCase().includes(q))
            );
        }

        // Event Listener Input Search Real-Time
        document.getElementById('ticket-search-input').addEventListener('input', function(e) {
            ticketSearchQuery = e.target.value.trim();
            currentTicketPage = 1;
            renderTicketsTable();
        });

        document.getElementById('asset-search-input').addEventListener('input', function(e) {
            assetSearchQuery = e.target.value.trim();
            currentAssetPage = 1;
            renderAssetsTable();
        });

        // ==================== INISIALISASI CHART.JS ====================
        Chart.defaults.font.family = "'Inter', sans-serif";
        Chart.defaults.color = '#64748b';

        const ticketStatusChart = new Chart(document.getElementById('ticketStatusChart'), {
            type: 'doughnut',
            data: {
                labels: ['Open', 'In Progress', 'Resolved', 'Rejected'],
                datasets: [{
                    data: [0, 0, 0, 0],
                    backgroundColor: ['#3b82f6', '#06b6d4', '#22c55e', '#ef4444'],
                    borderWidth: 0,
                    hoverOffset: 4
                }]
            },
            options: {
                responsive: true,
                maintainAspectRatio: false,
                cutout: '68%',
                plugins: {
                    legend: { position: 'bottom', labels: { boxWidth: 12, padding: 14, font: { size: 11 } } }
                }
            }
        });

        const assetTypeChart = new Chart(document.getElementById('assetTypeChart'), {
            type: 'bar',
            data: {
                labels: ['Laptop', 'PC Desktop', 'Monitor', 'Printer', 'Aksesoris', 'Lainnya'],
                datasets: [{
                    label: 'Jumlah Unit',
                    data: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0],
                    backgroundColor: '#6366f1',
                    borderRadius: 6,
                    barThickness: 22
                }]
            },
            options: {
                responsive: true,
                maintainAspectRatio: false,
                plugins: { legend: { display: false } },
                scales: {
                    y: { beginAtZero: true, ticks: { stepSize: 1, precision: 0 }, grid: { color: '#f1f5f9' } },
                    x: { grid: { display: false }, ticks: { font: { size: 11 } } }
                }
            }
        });

        const assetConditionChart = new Chart(document.getElementById('assetConditionChart'), {
            type: 'doughnut',
            data: {
                labels: ['Baik / Normal', 'Rusak Ringan', 'Maintenance', 'Rusak Berat'],
                datasets: [{
                    data: [0, 0, 0, 0],
                    backgroundColor: ['#10b981', '#f59e0b', '#3b82f6', '#ef4444'],
                    borderWidth: 0,
                    hoverOffset: 4
                }]
            },
            options: {
                responsive: true,
                maintainAspectRatio: false,
                cutout: '68%',
                plugins: {
                    legend: { position: 'bottom', labels: { boxWidth: 12, padding: 14, font: { size: 11 } } }
                }
            }
        });

        function updateChartsAndKPI(tickets, assets) {
            document.getElementById('kpi-total-tickets').innerText = tickets.length;
            document.getElementById('kpi-open-tickets').innerText = tickets.filter(t => t.status === 'Open' || t.status === 'In Progress').length;
            document.getElementById('kpi-total-assets').innerText = assets.length;
            document.getElementById('kpi-issue-assets').innerText = assets.filter(a => a.kondisi !== 'Baik / Normal').length;

            ticketStatusChart.data.datasets[0].data = [
                tickets.filter(t => t.status === 'Open').length,
                tickets.filter(t => t.status === 'In Progress').length,
                tickets.filter(t => t.status === 'Resolved').length,
                tickets.filter(t => t.status === 'Rejected').length
            ];
            ticketStatusChart.update();

            assetTypeChart.data.datasets[0].data = [
                assets.filter(a => a.jenis_perangkat === 'Laptop').length,
                assets.filter(a => a.jenis_perangkat === 'PC Desktop').length,
                assets.filter(a => a.jenis_perangkat === 'Monitor').length,
                assets.filter(a => a.jenis_perangkat === 'Printer/Scanner').length,
                assets.filter(a => a.jenis_perangkat === 'Mouse/Keyboard').length,
                assets.filter(a => a.jenis_perangkat === 'Lainnya').length
            ];
            assetTypeChart.update();

            assetConditionChart.data.datasets[0].data = [
                assets.filter(a => a.kondisi === 'Baik / Normal').length,
                assets.filter(a => a.kondisi === 'Rusak Ringan').length,
                assets.filter(a => a.kondisi === 'Perlu Maintenance').length,
                assets.filter(a => a.kondisi === 'Rusak Berat').length
            ];
            assetConditionChart.update();
        }

        // ==================== HELPER PAGINATION ====================
        function buildPaginationHTML(totalItems, currentPage, onPageChangeFnName) {
            const totalPages = Math.ceil(totalItems / ITEMS_PER_PAGE);
            if (totalPages <= 1) return '';

            let html = `
                <li class="page-item ${currentPage === 1 ? 'disabled' : ''}">
                    <button class="page-link" onclick="${onPageChangeFnName}(${currentPage - 1})">&laquo; Prev</button>
                </li>
            `;

            let startPage = Math.max(1, currentPage - 2);
            let endPage = Math.min(totalPages, startPage + 4);
            if (endPage - startPage < 4) {
                startPage = Math.max(1, endPage - 4);
            }

            if (startPage > 1) {
                html += `<li class="page-item"><button class="page-link" onclick="${onPageChangeFnName}(1)">1</button></li>`;
                if (startPage > 2) html += `<li class="page-item disabled"><span class="page-link">...</span></li>`;
            }

            for (let p = startPage; p <= endPage; p++) {
                html += `
                    <li class="page-item ${p === currentPage ? 'active' : ''}">
                        <button class="page-link" onclick="${onPageChangeFnName}(${p})">${p}</button>
                    </li>
                `;
            }

            if (endPage < totalPages) {
                if (endPage < totalPages - 1) html += `<li class="page-item disabled"><span class="page-link">...</span></li>`;
                html += `<li class="page-item"><button class="page-link" onclick="${onPageChangeFnName}(${totalPages})">${totalPages}</button></li>`;
            }

            html += `
                <li class="page-item ${currentPage === totalPages ? 'disabled' : ''}">
                    <button class="page-link" onclick="${onPageChangeFnName}(${currentPage + 1})">Next &raquo;</button>
                </li>
            `;
            return html;
        }

        function changeTicketPage(page) {
            const totalPages = Math.ceil(getFilteredTickets().length / ITEMS_PER_PAGE);
            if (page < 1 || page > totalPages) return;
            currentTicketPage = page;
            renderTicketsTable();
        }

        function changeAssetPage(page) {
            const totalPages = Math.ceil(getFilteredAssets().length / ITEMS_PER_PAGE);
            if (page < 1 || page > totalPages) return;
            currentAssetPage = page;
            renderAssetsTable();
        }

        // ==================== RENDER TABEL DENGAN PAGINATION ====================
        function renderTicketsTable() {
            const ticketBody = document.getElementById('ticket-table-body');
            const infoEl = document.getElementById('ticket-pagination-info');
            const controlsEl = document.getElementById('ticket-pagination-controls');
            const filteredTickets = getFilteredTickets();

            if (filteredTickets.length === 0) {
                const emptyMsg = ticketSearchQuery
                    ? `Tidak ditemukan tiket yang cocok dengan kata kunci "<strong>${escapeStr(ticketSearchQuery)}</strong>".`
                    : 'Belum ada tiket masuk.';
                ticketBody.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan="8" class="text-center text-muted py-4">${emptyMsg}</td></tr>`;
                infoEl.innerText = 'Menampilkan 0 data';
                controlsEl.innerHTML = '';
                return;
            }

            const totalPages = Math.ceil(filteredTickets.length / ITEMS_PER_PAGE);
            if (currentTicketPage > totalPages) currentTicketPage = totalPages;

            const startIdx = (currentTicketPage - 1) * ITEMS_PER_PAGE;
            const endIdx = Math.min(startIdx + ITEMS_PER_PAGE, filteredTickets.length);
            const pageItems = filteredTickets.slice(startIdx, endIdx);

            let ticketHtml = '';
            pageItems.forEach(t => {
                let prioritasBadge = 'bg-secondary bg-opacity-10 text-secondary';
                if (t.prioritas === 'Urgent') prioritasBadge = 'bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger';
                else if (t.prioritas === 'High') prioritasBadge = 'bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning text-dark';
                else if (t.prioritas === 'Medium') prioritasBadge = 'bg-info bg-opacity-10 text-info text-dark';

                let statusBadge = 'bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary';
                if (t.status === 'Resolved') statusBadge = 'bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success';
                else if (t.status === 'In Progress') statusBadge = 'bg-info bg-opacity-10 text-info text-dark';
                else if (t.status === 'Rejected') statusBadge = 'bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger';

                ticketHtml += `
                    <tr>
                        <td class="ps-4 fw-semibold text-dark">${t.ticket_code}</td>
                        ${currentUserRole === 'admin' ? `<td><div class="fw-medium text-dark">${t.pemohon}</div><span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">${t.departemen}</span></td>` : ''}
                        <td><span class="badge bg-light text-secondary border">${t.kategori}</span></td>
                        <td class="col-wrap">
                            <div class="fw-semibold text-dark">${t.judul}</div>
                            <div class="text-muted text-truncate" style="max-width: 300px; font-size: 0.8rem;">${t.deskripsi}</div>
                        </td>
                        <td><span class="badge ${prioritasBadge}">${t.prioritas}</span></td>
                        <td><span class="badge ${statusBadge}">${t.status}</span></td>
                        <td><span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem;">${t.catatan_it || '-'}</span></td>
                        ${currentUserRole === 'admin' ? `
                            <td class="text-end pe-4">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border px-3" 
                                    onclick="openEditModal('${t.id}', '${escapeStr(t.ticket_code)}', '${escapeStr(t.status)}', '${escapeStr(t.catatan_it)}')">
                                    <i class="bi bi-pencil-square me-1"></i> Update
                                </button>
                            </td>
                        ` : ''}
                    </tr>
                `;
            });

            ticketBody.innerHTML = ticketHtml;
            infoEl.innerText = `Menampilkan ${startIdx + 1} - ${endIdx} dari ${filteredTickets.length} tiket`;
            controlsEl.innerHTML = buildPaginationHTML(filteredTickets.length, currentTicketPage, 'changeTicketPage');
        }

        function renderAssetsTable() {
            const assetBody = document.getElementById('asset-table-body');
            const infoEl = document.getElementById('asset-pagination-info');
            const controlsEl = document.getElementById('asset-pagination-controls');
            const filteredAssets = getFilteredAssets();

            if (filteredAssets.length === 0) {
                const emptyMsg = assetSearchQuery
                    ? `Tidak ditemukan perangkat yang cocok dengan kata kunci "<strong>${escapeStr(assetSearchQuery)}</strong>".`
                    : 'Belum ada data perangkat terdaftar.';
                assetBody.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan="9" class="text-center text-muted py-4">${emptyMsg}</td></tr>`;
                infoEl.innerText = 'Menampilkan 0 data';
                controlsEl.innerHTML = '';
                return;
            }

            const totalPages = Math.ceil(filteredAssets.length / ITEMS_PER_PAGE);
            if (currentAssetPage > totalPages) currentAssetPage = totalPages;

            const startIdx = (currentAssetPage - 1) * ITEMS_PER_PAGE;
            const endIdx = Math.min(startIdx + ITEMS_PER_PAGE, filteredAssets.length);
            const pageItems = filteredAssets.slice(startIdx, endIdx);

            let assetHtml = '';
            pageItems.forEach(a => {
                let kondisiBadge = 'bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success';
                if (a.kondisi === 'Rusak Berat') kondisiBadge = 'bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger';
                else if (a.kondisi !== 'Baik / Normal') kondisiBadge = 'bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning text-dark';

                assetHtml += `
                    <tr>
                        ${currentUserRole === 'admin'
                            ? `<td class="ps-4"><div class="fw-medium text-dark">${a.pemegang}</div><span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">${a.departemen}</span></td>`
                            : ''
                        }
                        <td class="${currentUserRole !== 'admin' ? 'ps-4' : ''}">
                            <span class="badge bg-light text-secondary border">${a.jenis_perangkat}</span>
                        </td>
                        <td class="fw-semibold text-dark">${a.merk_tipe}</td>
                        <td><code class="text-primary bg-light px-2 py-1 rounded small">${a.serial_number}</code></td>
                        <td><span class="text-muted">${a.kode_aset || '-'}</span></td>
                        <td><span class="badge ${kondisiBadge}">${a.kondisi}</span></td>
                        <td>${a.kelengkapan}</td>
                        <td class="text-muted">${a.keterangan || '-'}</td>
                        <td class="text-end pe-4">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border px-3"
                                onclick="openAssetModal('${a.id}', '${escapeStr(a.merk_tipe)}', '${escapeStr(a.kondisi)}', '${escapeStr(a.kelengkapan)}', '${escapeStr(a.keterangan)}')">
                                <i class="bi bi-pencil-square me-1"></i> Update
                            </button>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                `;
            });

            assetBody.innerHTML = assetHtml;
            infoEl.innerText = `Menampilkan ${startIdx + 1} - ${endIdx} dari ${filteredAssets.length} perangkat`;
            controlsEl.innerHTML = buildPaginationHTML(filteredAssets.length, currentAssetPage, 'changeAssetPage');
        }

        // ==================== MODAL & AJAX POLLING ====================
        function openEditModal(id, code, status, note) {
            const form = document.getElementById('editTicketForm');
            if (!form) return;
            form.action = `/tickets/${id}/update`;
            document.getElementById('modal-ticket-code').innerText = code;
            document.getElementById('modal-ticket-status').value = status;
            document.getElementById('modal-ticket-note').value = note || '';
            
            const modal = new bootstrap.Modal(document.getElementById('editTicketModal'));
            modal.show();
        }

        function openAssetModal(id, merkTipe, kondisi, kelengkapan, keterangan) {
            document.getElementById('editAssetForm').action = `/assets/${id}/update`;
            document.getElementById('modal-asset-name').innerText = merkTipe;
            document.getElementById('modal-asset-kondisi').value = kondisi;
            document.getElementById('modal-asset-kelengkapan').value = kelengkapan;
            document.getElementById('modal-asset-keterangan').value = keterangan || '';

            const modal = new bootstrap.Modal(document.getElementById('editAssetModal'));
            modal.show();
        }

        function escapeStr(str) {
            if (!str) return '';
            return String(str).replace(/'/g, "\\'").replace(/"/g, '&quot;').replace(/\n/g, ' ');
        }

        async function fetchDashboardData() {
            try {
                const response = await fetch('/api/dashboard-data');
                const result = await response.json();

                if (!result.success) return;

                const { userRole, currentUserId } = result;
                currentUserRole = userRole;

                // Pengaman lapis kedua: pastikan non-admin hanya merender data miliknya sendiri
                const filteredTickets = userRole === 'admin'
                    ? result.tickets
                    : result.tickets.filter(t => Number(t.user_id) === Number(currentUserId));

                const filteredAssets = userRole === 'admin'
                    ? result.assets
                    : result.assets.filter(a => Number(a.user_id) === Number(currentUserId));

                allTickets = filteredTickets;
                allAssets = filteredAssets;

                const currentTicketsSnapshot = JSON.stringify(filteredTickets);
                const currentAssetsSnapshot = JSON.stringify(filteredAssets);

                if (currentTicketsSnapshot !== lastTicketsSnapshot || currentAssetsSnapshot !== lastAssetsSnapshot) {
                    updateChartsAndKPI(filteredTickets, filteredAssets);
                }

                if (currentTicketsSnapshot !== lastTicketsSnapshot) {
                    lastTicketsSnapshot = currentTicketsSnapshot;
                    renderTicketsTable();
                }

                if (currentAssetsSnapshot !== lastAssetsSnapshot) {
                    lastAssetsSnapshot = currentAssetsSnapshot;
                    renderAssetsTable();
                }

            } catch (err) {
                console.error('Gagal mengambil data AJAX:', err);
            }
        }

        fetchDashboardData();
        setInterval(fetchDashboardData, 5000);
    </script>

    <!-- ==================== SWEETALERT2 SOP PENGGUNAAN LAPTOP ==================== -->
    <% if (typeof showSopAlert !== 'undefined' && showSopAlert) { %>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            Swal.fire({
                title: '<div class="fs-5 fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill text-primary me-2"></i>SOP Penggunaan & Keamanan Laptop</div>',
                html: `
                    <div class="text-start small" style="max-height: 360px; overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 8px; line-height: 1.55;">
                        <div class="text-start small" style="max-height: 55vh; overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 6px; line-height: 1.55;">
                            <!-- Isi SOP tetap sama -->
                        </div>

                        <p class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1">1. Aturan Umum & Perawatan Fisik</p>
                        <ul class="ps-3 mb-3 text-secondary">
                            <li><strong>Keamanan Fisik:</strong> Dilarang makan/minum di dekat laptop, wajib menggunakan tas pelindung saat mobilisasi, dan dilarang meninggalkan laptop tanpa pengawasan di area publik/kendaraan[cite: 1].</li>
                            <li><strong>Kunci Layar:</strong> Wajib mengaktifkan password/PIN dan menekan <code>Windows + L</code> setiap kali meninggalkan meja kerja[cite: 1].</li>
                            <li><strong>Penggunaan Charger:</strong> Pengisian daya hanya diwajibkan saat baterai habis; tidak dianjurkan terus-menerus mencolok charger sambil bekerja[cite: 1].</li>
                            <li><strong>Menutup Laptop:</strong> Dilarang menutup layar laptop dalam keadaan menyala; wajib dalam kondisi <strong>Sleep</strong> atau <strong>Shutdown</strong> terlebih dahulu[cite: 1].</li>
                            <li><strong>Jaringan & Penggunaan:</strong> Gunakan VPN resmi saat mengakses Wi-Fi publik dan gunakan laptop khusus untuk operasional pekerjaan[cite: 1].</li>
                        </ul>

                        <p class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1">2. Kebijakan Software & Larangan Keras</p>
                        <ul class="ps-3 mb-3 text-secondary">
                            <li>Akun Windows pengguna ditetapkan sebagai <strong>Standard User (Non-Admin)</strong>[cite: 1].</li>
                            <li><strong>Dilarang Keras Menginstal:</strong> Aplikasi Torrent/P2P, Game & Emulator (Steam, BlueStacks, dll.), Remote Access pribadi tanpa izin IT (AnyDesk/TeamViewer pribadi), VPN/Proxy gratis tidak terverifikasi, serta aplikasi cleaner/optimizer (CCleaner, Driver Booster, dll.)[cite: 2].</li>
                            <li>Permintaan instalasi software tambahan wajib diajukan melalui <strong>Sistem Ticketing IT</strong> dengan persetujuan Kepala Divisi[cite: 2, 3].</li>
                        </ul>

                        <p class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1">3. Audit & Sanksi Pelanggaran</p>
                        <ul class="ps-3 mb-0 text-secondary">
                            <li>Departemen IT berhak melakukan audit berkala dan menghapus (<em>uninstall</em>) aplikasi ilegal tanpa pemberitahuan sebelumnya[cite: 3].</li>
                            <li>Pelanggaran berulang atau kerusakan/kebocoran data akibat kelalaian akan dilaporkan ke <strong>HR & GA</strong> untuk dikenakan sanksi perusahaan[cite: 3].</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                `,
                width: window.innerWidth < 768 ? '95%' : '680px',                
                confirmButtonText: '<i class="bi bi-check-circle me-1"></i> Oke, Saya Mengerti & Setuju',
                confirmButtonColor: '#0d6efd',
                allowOutsideClick: false,
                allowEscapeKey: false,
                allowEnterKey: false,
                backdrop: 'rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75)',
                customClass: {
                    popup: 'rounded-4 shadow-lg border-0',
                    confirmButton: 'btn btn-primary px-4 py-2 fw-semibold rounded-3'
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
    <% } %>
</body>
</html>